## Naming Rules Summary

| Type              | Naming Convention             | Example                   |
|-------------------|-------------------------------|---------------------------|
| Vue Component     | `PascalCase.vue`              | `UserCard.vue`            |
| Composable        | `useCamelCase.ts`             | `useModal.ts`             |
| Interface/Type    | `PascalCase.ts`               | `User.ts`                 |
| Service           | `camelCase.service.ts`        | `user.service.ts`         |
| Constants/Enums   | `camelCase.ts`, `UPPER_CASE`  | `api.ts`, `ROLES.ts`      |
| Store Slice       | `camelCase.slice.ts`          | `user.slice.ts`           |
| Router Module     | `camelCase.ts`                | `admin.ts`, `auth.ts`     |
| Utils             | `camelCase.ts`                | `validators.ts`           |
